{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29019","headline":"与郑二秀才同舟东下洛中亲朋送至景云寺 · 许浑","name":"与郑二秀才同舟东下洛中亲朋送至景云寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十六峰横一川，绿波无路草芊芊。\n牛羊晚食铺平地，鵰鹗晴飞摩远天。\n洛客尽回临水寺，楚人皆逐下江船。\n东西未有相逢日，更把繁华共醉眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}